---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Button from "../Button.astro";
import portrait from "../../assets/maya-portrait-figma.png";
---

<section class="band-light meet" id="work-with-maya">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <figure class="media">
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Maya Reynolds standing beside a pool, holding a stopwatch"
        widths={[420, 508]}
        sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="copy">
      <h2>Meet <em class="accent caps">Maya Reynolds</em></h2>

      <p>
        I know what it feels like to be physically prepared and still struggle
        to show it when the result matters most. As a competitive swimmer, I
        learned that racing well requires more than fitness, technique, and a
        perfectly planned taper. It requires the ability to manage pressure,
        trust your preparation, and stay present when the clock starts.
      </p>

      <p>
        That experience led me to mental performance coaching. Today, I help
        competitive swimmers develop practical skills for confidence, focus,
        composure, and resilience. Race Ready is not about eliminating nerves
        or forcing positive thoughts. It is about giving athletes a system they
        can rely on through demanding practices, difficult results, and
        high-pressure meets.
      </p>

      <Button href="#about" class="cta">Read Maya&rsquo;s Story</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .meet {
    height: var(--size-meet-height);
    padding-block: var(--sp-content) var(--sp-sm);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--size-meet-media-width) var(--size-meet-copy);
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .media {
    position: relative;
    width: var(--size-meet-media-width);
    height: var(--size-meet-media-height);
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-feature);
    transform: scaleX(-1);
  }

  .media :global(img) {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15.72%;
    left: -20.42%;
    width: 122.99%;
    height: 152.7%;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .copy { width: var(--size-meet-copy); }

  .copy p {
    font-size: var(--type-body-18);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }

  .copy p:first-of-type { margin-top: var(--sp-sm); }
  .copy p + p { margin-top: var(--sp-paragraph); }

  .copy :global(.cta) { margin-top: var(--sp-med); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .meet {
      height: auto;
      padding-block: var(--sp-footer);
    }

    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-lg);
    }

    .media,
    .copy { width: 100%; }

    .media { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 508 / 575; }
  }
</style>
